# Governance

- Never invent qualifications, prices, contact details, testimonials, DBS status, locations, or results.
- If a fact is missing, omit the public claim. Record the gap in `docs/CONTENT_GAPS.md`.
- Do not add databases, auth, Stripe, CMS, booking widgets, or analytics without a current feature need.
- Edit public facts in `src/content/`. Do not scatter service copy through JSX.
- Secrets stay out of Git. V1 has no required environment variables.
- Before release: `npm run health`, `npm run build`, and `git diff --check`.
